PROCEDURE GETPRO
IF MODIFICA
 UNLOCK
ENDIF
SET ORDER TO 1
@  4,20 GET XCODCLI  PICT '@!' when !haymovcxc(xcodcli) VALID CHK_CLAVE(XCODCLI,[Proveedor])
@  5,20 GET XNOMCLI  PICT '@S55'
@ 16,55 SAY SPACE(15)
