@  7,20 GET XCIF
@  8,20 GET XNIT
@  9,20 GET XDIREC1
@ 10,20 GET XDIREC2
@ 11,20 GET XDIREC3
@ 12,20 GET XDIREC4
@ 13,20 GET XTLF1
